WEBVTT

00:56.974 --> 00:58.100
Thank you.

00:58.600 --> 00:59.601
All right.

01:00.686 --> 01:02.479
No, no, no. I got this.

01:09.862 --> 01:10.863
See you around.

01:17.244 --> 01:18.537
Can't believe it's over.

01:19.997 --> 01:23.166
I'm gonna take Evan to a Red Sox game.

01:26.420 --> 01:27.629
Leave you with this?

01:28.422 --> 01:30.299
- See you later.
- See you later.

01:48.192 --> 01:49.776
Do you think it's skin cancer?

01:50.485 --> 01:52.446
Oh, yeah. Yes.

02:09.338 --> 02:10.339
Tom?

02:11.924 --> 02:14.050
The phone's been ringing off the hook.

02:14.051 --> 02:15.343
Mitch called.

02:15.344 --> 02:18.222
Ray Mellor called. Kurt Warburton called.

02:18.972 --> 02:21.057
They've been looking for you for two days.

02:21.058 --> 02:22.351
Ruth,

02:23.101 --> 02:25.229
don't worry. Everything's fine.

03:12.776 --> 03:13.777
Okay.

03:42.931 --> 03:43.932
Evan?

03:44.892 --> 03:46.351
I got sandwiches!

03:50.439 --> 03:53.984
And it looks like you've got mail!

03:56.820 --> 03:58.071
Welcome home, Tom.

03:59.239 --> 04:01.241
Hey. You were asleep this morning, I…

04:07.581 --> 04:08.916
You went through the basement?

04:13.003 --> 04:16.089
No, I went through your trunk.
What the hell is in the basement?

04:19.635 --> 04:22.012
This is the Driftwood Diner.
Leave a message.

04:23.180 --> 04:24.681
Hello. My name is Patricia.

04:26.099 --> 04:30.353
I ordered a chicken parm
and a slice of the coconut cream pie,

04:30.354 --> 04:35.776
and I've got a turkey patty with no bun
and a single sausage link.

04:37.027 --> 04:38.778
And I don't want a refund,

04:38.779 --> 04:42.698
I just want the person
who did this to find out.

04:42.699 --> 04:44.992
And I don't want the person
who did this to get into trouble,

04:44.993 --> 04:49.288
I just… you know,
I just want them to learn from it.

04:49.289 --> 04:50.581
I don't…

04:50.582 --> 04:52.291
- Better yet, I think I--
- The mailbox is full

04:52.292 --> 04:54.920
and cannot accept any messages
at this time. Goodbye.

04:55.796 --> 04:56.797
Great.

05:05.556 --> 05:09.309
I'd love to know the story
behind this heartwarming pic.

05:10.727 --> 05:13.647
- I mean, what the fuck?
- Okay. Okay.

05:14.898 --> 05:17.192
Why did you tell me
she died during childbirth?

05:20.654 --> 05:22.030
Because she did.

05:24.575 --> 05:26.325
She was never the same
after you were born.

05:26.326 --> 05:27.578
Okay.

05:28.120 --> 05:29.121
What does that mean?

05:31.123 --> 05:34.626
She had a preeclampsia-induced stroke.

05:35.127 --> 05:37.379
And after that, she wasn't right.

05:38.589 --> 05:39.755
She wasn't right how?

05:39.756 --> 05:42.384
It did something to her brain.

05:43.385 --> 05:44.386
To her mind.

05:46.013 --> 05:48.098
And it affected her behavior.

05:52.978 --> 05:55.105
She wasn't safe to be around.

05:56.440 --> 05:57.816
And so, I had…

05:59.735 --> 06:01.653
I had to commit her to The Home.

06:03.864 --> 06:05.281
What's "The Home"?

06:05.282 --> 06:08.784
It was a very nice home here on the island

06:08.785 --> 06:12.330
for people struggling with mental issues.

06:12.331 --> 06:14.749
Like a mental institution?

06:14.750 --> 06:16.376
- Like an insane asylum?
- No.

06:21.840 --> 06:22.925
Yeah.

06:25.385 --> 06:28.847
She died two years later
of a brain aneurysm.

06:33.185 --> 06:34.937
She loved you so much.

06:42.861 --> 06:44.279
Yeah, I read the letters.

06:47.449 --> 06:48.617
Can I read one?

06:51.370 --> 06:52.954
"Dear Evan,

06:52.955 --> 06:55.248
I need your baby hands to get the keys

06:55.249 --> 06:57.291
and your little fingers
to reach up my nose

06:57.292 --> 06:59.086
to pull the scorpion out of my brain.

06:59.586 --> 07:00.963
Watch out for that stinger.

07:01.964 --> 07:02.965
Love, your mother."

07:09.137 --> 07:10.138
That's nice.

07:11.390 --> 07:12.391
That's really nice.

07:14.434 --> 07:15.435
Another?

07:15.978 --> 07:17.020
"Dear Evan…"

07:23.527 --> 07:24.695
Oh, God. You…

07:25.821 --> 07:29.156
- Oh, my God. You scared me.
- I'm sorry. Sorry.

07:29.157 --> 07:30.158
Oh, gee…

07:34.997 --> 07:36.164
Can we talk?

07:37.124 --> 07:38.541
Yeah. Of course, yeah.

07:38.542 --> 07:40.210
- What is it, Wyck?
- Yeah. Right.

07:41.461 --> 07:42.462
Well…

07:45.090 --> 07:48.051
there's something I've had
in my wallet for a very long time,

07:48.552 --> 07:49.553
and…

07:50.762 --> 07:52.431
I think it's time I tell you why.

08:03.066 --> 08:05.027
- Remember the… Yeah.
- Oh, yes, I do.

08:09.698 --> 08:11.157
Hey, honey.

08:11.158 --> 08:12.826
Hey there, Wyck. Hey.

08:13.327 --> 08:14.786
Well, look at that.

08:15.829 --> 08:18.581
Honey, that's your
high school sweetheart, Wyck.

08:18.582 --> 08:20.751
- Yeah.
- You old dog.

08:23.629 --> 08:24.671
Yeah.

08:25.380 --> 08:27.465
Well, I better get going.

08:27.466 --> 08:31.512
I got a lot of photos
I gotta give away today.

08:33.347 --> 08:34.764
Okay, okay.

08:34.765 --> 08:35.932
Well…

08:35.933 --> 08:36.933
Yeah.

08:39.770 --> 08:42.397
Mind the glass.
I might not have gotten it all.

08:45.859 --> 08:47.194
What happened here?

08:50.239 --> 08:53.575
Probably tourist kids
who heard the Boogeyman stories.

09:28.986 --> 09:31.196
I think… leave.

09:31.905 --> 09:35.324
I'm gonna say goodbye. Disgusting.

09:35.325 --> 09:36.326
Okay.

09:38.453 --> 09:39.787
Yeah.

09:39.788 --> 09:41.790
Okay. So I might need these…

09:48.130 --> 09:49.131
Yeah.

15:03.779 --> 15:04.780
Open the door!

15:05.489 --> 15:06.490
Open the door.

15:07.366 --> 15:08.492
Open the door.

15:09.326 --> 15:10.409
I…

15:10.410 --> 15:11.745
No! Oh, God.

15:35.644 --> 15:36.687
Oh, God.

15:57.916 --> 15:59.209
Patricia!

16:02.504 --> 16:03.589
Patricia!

16:19.021 --> 16:20.856
Help! Wyck!

16:22.983 --> 16:24.776
Oh, God. Help!

16:30.365 --> 16:32.284
Help! Help!

16:33.744 --> 16:34.745
Help!

16:39.708 --> 16:41.334
Hel… Hel…

16:41.335 --> 16:42.711
Hey! Hey!

16:43.337 --> 16:45.297
Help! It's Patricia!

16:45.923 --> 16:47.674
Hey! Help!

16:48.634 --> 16:52.178
"All spring she'd worn the half-a-heart
pendant while Samuel wore the other half."

16:52.179 --> 16:53.471
- What?
- You remember those?

16:53.472 --> 16:55.723
- Those little pendants?
- That's your favorite part?

16:55.724 --> 16:57.058
- Whatever. I know…
- That is cute.

16:57.059 --> 16:58.936
- …I seem so cold, but I have a heart.
- That is goofy.

17:00.062 --> 17:01.229
Oh, my God!

17:01.230 --> 17:02.605
- Patricia?
- What the fuck?

17:02.606 --> 17:03.814
What is she doing here?

17:03.815 --> 17:05.441
I know I didn't invite her this time.

17:05.442 --> 17:06.567
- I just…
- What the…

17:06.568 --> 17:08.277
Patricia, can I help you?

17:08.278 --> 17:10.321
- What are you doing?
- What is going on?

17:10.906 --> 17:12.280
Seriously?

17:12.281 --> 17:14.408
- Excuse me. What are you doing?
- No. Shut up.

17:14.409 --> 17:16.452
- Patricia--
- Shut the fuck up!

17:16.453 --> 17:18.828
- Oh, my gosh. Patricia.
- What is happening right now?

17:18.829 --> 17:20.164
- I…
- Patricia?

17:20.165 --> 17:21.875
Call the police! He's back!

17:22.459 --> 17:24.544
- Who's back?
- You know who.

17:24.545 --> 17:27.129
The Boogeyman! Call the police!

17:27.130 --> 17:28.589
- What? Okay…
- Call the police.

17:28.590 --> 17:31.301
…you have to be joking.
Are you really still doing this?

17:32.010 --> 17:33.970
- The phone line is out.
- Oh, my God.

17:33.971 --> 17:35.764
- What?
- That's strange.

17:38.392 --> 17:39.434
Do you have a back door?

17:40.894 --> 17:42.938
- Okay.
- Do you have a back door?

17:43.730 --> 17:46.315
- Yes, yes.
- All right, make sure it's locked. Now!

17:46.316 --> 17:48.943
- And turn off all the lights.
- No, no!

17:48.944 --> 17:50.320
Don't play her game.

17:50.821 --> 17:53.407
Don't… Everybody knows
that she lied about the calls.

17:56.368 --> 17:57.953
All right. I lied about the calls.

17:58.579 --> 17:59.996
- I knew it!
- Oh, my God.

17:59.997 --> 18:01.247
- Didn't I say it?
- You said it.

18:01.248 --> 18:02.331
- You said it!
- I said it.

18:02.332 --> 18:04.542
I just… I felt left out,

18:04.543 --> 18:06.836
I told one person, they told everyone,

18:06.837 --> 18:08.462
and then I had to double down.

18:08.463 --> 18:09.881
But I swear to God,

18:09.882 --> 18:13.093
he came to my house that night,
and I swear he's back.

18:14.178 --> 18:15.678
Okay. Good to know.

18:15.679 --> 18:17.346
- Bye-bye.
- Kris, I'm just telling you

18:17.347 --> 18:18.724
- so that you--
- Go away!

18:19.308 --> 18:22.102
Stop making this about you.
It's not about you!

18:23.395 --> 18:26.314
I'm sorry, but I am not the reason
that you don't have any friends.

18:26.315 --> 18:28.900
It's because you're fucking insane. Okay?

18:28.901 --> 18:30.776
Your little party?
It almost killed everyone.

18:30.777 --> 18:32.779
And now you've ruined book club.

18:33.280 --> 18:34.615
You're so annoying.

18:35.199 --> 18:37.743
Just go bye-bye, all right?

18:39.077 --> 18:40.078
Go bye-bye.

18:40.996 --> 18:42.706
Bye-bye. Okay?

18:43.749 --> 18:44.750
Bye-bye.

18:45.584 --> 18:46.959
Bye-b--

18:46.960 --> 18:48.920
Oh, my God. Kris!

18:48.921 --> 18:50.713
She's the worst! She's the fucking worst.

18:50.714 --> 18:52.340
And… I'm sorry.

18:52.341 --> 18:54.259
- Kris, are you okay?
- You okay?

18:55.219 --> 18:56.220
Hello?

18:59.056 --> 19:00.515
Where's she going?

19:00.516 --> 19:01.767
Patricia. What?

19:07.814 --> 19:10.400
Guys, I'm gonna call 911
to report the incident here.

19:15.656 --> 19:17.783
God. I want her to get off my lawn.

19:29.586 --> 19:30.921
She's still out there?

19:38.387 --> 19:40.889
He's inside the house! Get…

19:41.682 --> 19:42.891
Get out of there!

19:43.892 --> 19:44.893
Get…

19:46.311 --> 19:47.812
Oh, d…

19:47.813 --> 19:49.230
He's gonna kill you!

19:49.231 --> 19:50.816
Get out of there!

19:55.737 --> 19:56.947
- Goddamn!
- What was that?

20:08.000 --> 20:09.042
Fuck!

20:19.845 --> 20:22.431
No! No!

20:32.691 --> 20:34.109
Can you hear me?

20:35.152 --> 20:37.988
Hey, hey. Take it easy.

20:38.906 --> 20:40.365
Looks like you hit your head.

20:40.908 --> 20:43.869
I've got a pulse. He's alive.

20:44.661 --> 20:45.662
No, no, no.

20:47.164 --> 20:48.664
Give me your keys. I'll run him over.

20:48.665 --> 20:49.832
- What?
- Give me your keys.

20:49.833 --> 20:51.126
I need to run him over.

20:51.668 --> 20:52.752
Welcome back, bud.

20:52.753 --> 20:53.754
Run!

20:55.923 --> 20:57.131
Just run!

20:57.132 --> 20:58.175
- Oh, fuck!
- Just…

21:22.866 --> 21:23.867
No!

21:35.921 --> 21:36.922
"Dear Evan.

21:37.589 --> 21:40.384
Everyone has two mothers.
A mother and a secret mother.

21:41.009 --> 21:42.218
Which one am I?

21:42.219 --> 21:45.013
I am your secret mom,
and I live in a secret house.

21:46.682 --> 21:48.891
They won't let me out.
When you're a little older,

21:48.892 --> 21:51.311
you can come here
and pretend to be that awful mailman.

21:51.812 --> 21:55.190
To review, I'm dead,
I'm dead, I'm already dead.

21:55.899 --> 21:58.402
It's too late. Come soon. Mother."

22:00.612 --> 22:01.613
Sounds good.

22:29.099 --> 22:31.059
This was your mother.

22:32.311 --> 22:33.312
And this.

22:39.568 --> 22:40.569
This.

22:44.114 --> 22:45.115
This.

22:50.579 --> 22:52.497
And this person

22:53.874 --> 22:56.084
wouldn't want you to remember the other.

23:03.217 --> 23:04.843
Why did you hide those from me?

23:06.136 --> 23:08.722
Because they make me sadder
than I already am.

23:12.935 --> 23:14.436
I'm so sorry, Evan.

23:22.486 --> 23:24.446
Why do we never leave this island?

23:27.491 --> 23:28.575
We can.

23:31.370 --> 23:32.996
We can leave this island.

23:43.841 --> 23:45.174
- Sox tickets?
- Yeah.

23:45.175 --> 23:46.551
- Is this real?
- Yes, it's real.

23:46.552 --> 23:47.885
- Yeah--
- We… No.

23:47.886 --> 23:50.847
It… We're gonna make
a weekend of it in Boston.

23:50.848 --> 23:52.682
- This weekend.
- You're being serious?

23:52.683 --> 23:54.184
Yes, I'm being serious.

23:55.102 --> 23:57.563
Because things are gonna
be different from now on.

24:28.844 --> 24:30.262
- How's it going?
- Hey.

25:09.551 --> 25:10.552
Fuck.

25:15.474 --> 25:18.519
I have to eat this here.
My wife can't stand the smell. So…

25:19.895 --> 25:21.480
- Cool.
- …can you give me…

25:22.397 --> 25:23.398
I need 20 on three.

25:24.483 --> 25:25.609
Twenty on three.

25:45.170 --> 25:46.755
You're not supposed to do that.

25:47.339 --> 25:49.466
Oh, my God.

26:09.570 --> 26:11.905
Oh, my God!

26:18.328 --> 26:19.872
No, no, no!

26:22.040 --> 26:23.500
Fucking hell.

26:28.755 --> 26:31.758
No, don't! No, you're ruining it!

26:32.759 --> 26:33.760
Oh, my…

26:39.057 --> 26:40.350
Put him down!

26:41.226 --> 26:43.061
Good God, may I live.

26:48.901 --> 26:50.277
Drop him!

28:17.155 --> 28:18.407
Is there another way out?

28:18.991 --> 28:21.285
- No.
- Okay, thank you so much.

28:37.593 --> 28:38.594
Okay.

29:06.371 --> 29:09.165
Coming up, what initially looked like
high winds is starting

29:09.166 --> 29:12.084
- to look like the storm of the century.
- Okay.

29:12.085 --> 29:13.795
No, I'm fine. I promise.

29:15.130 --> 29:18.217
It's… it's just a flesh wound.

29:18.759 --> 29:21.303
He just wants me to rest
for a couple weeks.

29:22.346 --> 29:24.473
Vermont's looking better now I bet.

29:26.099 --> 29:27.100
I love you.

29:27.643 --> 29:30.604
- I love you.
- I'm gonna get you another snack.

29:43.492 --> 29:44.493
Hi.

29:52.251 --> 29:54.044
I didn't know Chelle was pregnant.

29:55.796 --> 29:56.797
She is?

30:03.428 --> 30:07.057
I'm sorry. It's the morphine.
You know, Dr. Morgan doesn't play around.

30:08.642 --> 30:10.143
I thought she was in her 40s.

30:12.896 --> 30:14.690
You tryna die twice tonight?

30:15.274 --> 30:16.400
Does Loftis know?

30:17.568 --> 30:18.569
No.

30:20.195 --> 30:22.614
No, I figured all that stuff
with his wife…

30:23.907 --> 30:24.908
Yeah.

30:25.909 --> 30:26.910
Patricia.

30:27.828 --> 30:29.997
What the hell did I see out there?

30:41.008 --> 30:42.633
Listen to me. You have to go.

30:42.634 --> 30:44.719
No, see here.
You ain't gotta tell me twice.

30:44.720 --> 30:45.721
- I'm…
- No.

30:46.889 --> 30:47.890
Right now.

30:50.100 --> 30:51.810
You can't have your child here.

30:57.232 --> 30:58.233
Why?

30:58.817 --> 31:02.779
Shit. Well, I'm not learning shit
from any of this.

31:03.739 --> 31:06.490
You can't go to Boston
and not walk the Freedom Trail.

31:06.491 --> 31:08.827
I can't wait to go
and not walk the Freedom Trail.

31:10.996 --> 31:12.663
You know what we should do
while we're there?

31:12.664 --> 31:13.665
What?

31:14.541 --> 31:16.126
Check out some colleges.

31:18.420 --> 31:19.796
- Really?
- Yes, really.

31:20.297 --> 31:21.465
I would love…

31:31.600 --> 31:32.851
It's not over.

31:36.855 --> 31:37.856
No.
